    <briefdescription>
<para>Cached knowledge-graph enrichment interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Design constraints:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_i_k_g_enrichment_interface_1a3eca4e0fad04849a6ad3be4be6c23192" kindref="member">enrich()</ref> is read-only; it must never issue AQL write operations.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Cache key is derived deterministically from <ref refid="structthemis_1_1training_1_1_entity_ref" kindref="compound">EntityRef</ref> fields.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Cache entries have TTL enforcement; stale data is evicted before use.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_knowledge_graph_enricher" kindref="compound">KnowledgeGraphEnricher</ref> (concrete implementation) </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
